<title>JAPAN: Chuo Spring -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chuo Spring -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 25.45		vs	   24.91</p>
<p> Operating	  500    million    vs	  159    million</p>
<p> Current	    678    million    vs	  460    million</p>
<p> Net		  365    million    vs	  236    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.64 yen	  vs	    3.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     65 million	  vs	  65 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chuo Spring Co Ltd manufactures car springs and is affiliated with Toyota Motor Corp.</p>
</text>
